I am a co-editor of an underground newspaper at my school.  We recently 
were given our second warning about getting suspended by a VERY angry 
principal on the following two grounds:

1. We did not give the principal a copy 24 hours in advance.
2. We distributed the paper in places other than the cafeteria at lunch time.

The above two (24 hour advance copy and distributing only in the 
